<BlogLayout
  title="What Are As-Built Drawings? A Plain-English Guide"
  description="As-built drawings show a building exactly as it stands today. A simple explanation of what they are, what is in a set, who needs them, and how they are made."
  category="Guide"
  readTime="5 min"
  datePublished="2026-11-17"
  related={[
    { href: '/resources/why-every-project-starts-with-as-builts/', label: 'Why Every Building Project Starts With As-Built Drawings' },
    { href: '/resources/as-built-drawings-vs-original-plans/', label: 'As-Built Drawings vs. Original Plans' },
    { href: '/quote/', label: 'Get an instant quote' },
  ]}
>
  <p>An as-built drawing is a drawing of a building the way it is right now. Not the way it was planned, and not the way someone remembers it. The way it actually stands today, measured and drawn to scale.</p>

  <p>That is the whole idea. Everything else in this guide is detail.</p>

